    "text": "Hays\nConstruction underway on O'Loughlin Elementary School addition, renovation\n12 hours ago\nNabholz Construction is working on phase two of the O'Loughlin Elementary School renovation and addition. Footings and foundations are being prepared for Phase 2, which is indicated in blue on the floor plan above. That includes three classrooms, a bathroom and a shared study area that will also serve as a storm shelter for the school, Brett Collins, Nabholz's project executive, said.",
